main -> main: "create_*_agent() 넷 호출\n(ExaTools 셋 · Agent 넷)"
main -> db: "SqliteDb(db_file=\n\"tmp/gtm_outreach.db\")\n에이전트마다 한 번"
main -> user: "\"1/4 Finding companies...\""
